From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 01:23:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] AB monitor 1.6.3: Windows findings from txrx03 (OpenBLAS,
 BLAS threads, offline meters)

- Windows kit 1.1.0: NumPy BLAS pinned to OpenBLAS in both env specs
  (oneMKL 2026.1.0 crashed with 0xC06D007F inside np.dot on an i9);
  steps 4/5 wait for the emulator port (tests/wait_for_port.py);
  START_HERE: PowerShell/cmd notes, txrx03 results
- monitor 1.6.3: OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS defaults to 1 (2971 MB -> 18 MB commit);
  SKIP_PAGES_WHEN_UNREACHABLE; "no data received" final status;
  run_status() polls_with_data
- tests 0.0.3: unreachable meter, HTTP-500 page, no-data status, BLAS default
- docs: README, manual and START_HERE PDFs regenerated (LuaLaTeX)

Local commit only; not pushed (owner's instruction).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AKRKdP2fHw4teErHasQB2w
